 "description": "Grade an account renewal on weighted 90-day signals (adoption, sponsor strength, support sentiment, realised value) and quantify ARR at risk. See the full version at https://rahuldsarker.co/calculators/renewals-pipeline-health-grader",
 "inputSchema": {
